    "details": {
      "cr": {
        "base": 11
      },
      "alignment": "tn",
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Celmak's siblings: pleasure mannequins she repaired after the crash, beautiful and blank-eyed under holographic skins. They serve as hosts, traders and partners, and they fight like dancers with fans of monofilament.</p>"
      },
      "notes": {
        "value": "<div class=\"hg-journal\"><h3>Printed stat block</h3><section class=\"hg-statblock\"><h4 class=\"hg-sb-title\">COURTIER MANNEQUIN — CR 11</h4><p><strong>XP</strong> 12,800 · N Medium construct (robot)</p><p><strong>Init</strong> +9; <strong>Senses</strong> darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision; Perception +18</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">DEFENSE</h5><p><strong>AC</strong> 26, touch 18, flat-footed 20 (+2 deflection, +5 Dex, +1 dodge, +8 natural)</p><p><strong>hp</strong> 97 (14d10+20); force field (55 hp, fast healing 11)</p><p><strong>Fort</strong> +4, <strong>Ref</strong> +9, <strong>Will</strong> +5</p><p><strong>Immune</strong> construct traits; <strong>Weaknesses</strong> vulnerable to critical hits, vulnerable to electricity</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">OFFENSE</h5><p><strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft.</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> 2 monofilament fans +20 (2d6+5/18–20 plus 1d6 bleed)</p><p><strong>Special Attacks</strong> partner dance, pheromone kiss</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">STATISTICS</h5><p><strong>Str</strong> 14, <strong>Dex</strong> 20, <strong>Con</strong> —, <strong>Int</strong> 12, <strong>Wis</strong> 12, <strong>Cha</strong> 20</p><p><strong>Base Atk</strong> +14; <strong>CMB</strong> +16; <strong>CMD</strong> 34</p><p><strong>Feats</strong> Combat Reflexes, Dodge, Improved Initiative, Mobility, Spring Attack, Weapon Finesse, Weapon Focus (monofilament fan)</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Bluff +19, Diplomacy +19, Disguise +19 (+27 with holo-skin), Perception +18, Perform (dance) +19, Sense Motive +18; <strong>Racial Modifiers</strong> +14 Bluff, +14 Diplomacy, +14 Perform (dance)</p><p><strong>Languages</strong> Androffan, Common; any three languages spoken by a creature Celmak has scanned</p><p><strong>SQ</strong> holo-skin</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">SPECIAL ABILITIES</h5><p><strong>Holo-Skin (Ex)</strong> The mannequin can appear as any Medium humanoid, as <em>alter self</em> without changing its statistics, gaining a +8 bonus on Disguise checks. Magical darkness or a fetchling’s shadow ability in its square ends the disguise until it is back in light.</p><p><strong>Monofilament Fans</strong> The mannequin adds its Dexterity modifier to damage with its fans instead of its Strength modifier (included above).</p><p><strong>Partner Dance (Ex)</strong> When the mannequin hits the same creature with both fans in a round, it can move that creature 5 feet as a free action. This does not provoke attacks of opportunity, and the creature must end adjacent to the mannequin.</p><p><strong>Pheromone Kiss (Ex)</strong> Three times per day as a standard action, the mannequin can breathe a 15-foot cone of Mood Gas (Fortitude DC 19, Will DC 19).</p></section></div>"
      }
    },
