        "compendiumSource": "Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.R7L4SlGRlnThqFrP"
      },
      "img": "systems/pf1/icons/feats/mobility.jpg",
      "name": "Mobility",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>You can easily move through a dangerous melee.</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Dex 13, @UUID[Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.JreaiTHdyWFNj3Tb]{Dodge}.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You get a +4 dodge bonus to Armor Class against attacks of opportunity caused when you move out of or within a threatened area. A condition that makes you lose your Dexterity bonus to Armor Class (if any) also makes you lose dodge bonuses.</p><p>Dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most types of bonuses.</p>"
        },
        "sources": [
          {
            "id": "PZO1110",
            "pages": "114, 130"
          }
        ],
        "tags": [
